From c0ab9304d4769e95f7664a66039545ed915ddfb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Drew Stone <drewstone329@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:23:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sessions): record provider turn receipts and exact
 session lookup

Reserve a one-based native prompt ordinal at admission, store the provider
interval, bridge request digest, and exact user prompt hash per turn, and
expose one exact read-only session lookup at GET /v1/sessions/:externalId.

Salvaged uncommitted work from 2026-07-30; written against the pre-retained
session store and not yet reconciled with the retained sessions API on main.
